  "attributes": [
    {
      "id": 1236571,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "value": "## Zelda II: The Adventure of Link - Synopsis\n\nStep into a Hyrule shrouded in chaos in *Zelda II: The Adventure of Link*, a unique and pivotal entry in *The Legend of Zelda* series. Set after the events of the original game, Link embarks on a perilous quest to break a curse upon Princess Zelda, who slumbers within the North Castle. A grief-stricken prince, regretting his actions, has placed Zelda under an eternal sleep until a hero can restore peace to the land.\n\nThis installment boldly departs from the traditional top-down perspective, introducing side-scrolling action and RPG elements. Explore towns, interact with NPCs, and acquire powerful spells to aid your journey through six challenging palaces. Master new combat techniques and face formidable foes, including a shadowy manifestation of Link himself. \n\n*Zelda II* introduces a magic system with a dedicated gauge, allowing for strategic spellcasting. With limited lives and a unique progression system, this adventure demands skill and perseverance. Ultimately, Link must confront the lingering spirit of Ganon and retrieve the Triforce of Courage to awaken the princess and bring peace back to Hyrule."
    },
